@startuml
title State Machine: Vehicle
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
state Available
state InTransit
state Maintenance
state Reserved

[*] --> Available
Available --> Reserved : Assign (AssignVehicle)
Reserved --> InTransit : StartTrip (StartRoute)
InTransit --> Available : CompleteTrip (FinishRoute)
Available --> Maintenance : HoldForMaintenance (FlagMaintenance)
@enduml
